{"title":"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For an arbitrary real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/1/441416e660d25335f27e55334ac2a06e51541c97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> denotes the greatest integer not exceeding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Prove that there is exactly one integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> which satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/0/40060455609a5b41b0a731d5dc1f8d654e8dc056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor=2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First we will show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/188ff54fb17d78ba1e5d7470da98f02318230255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2006$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" /> is a solution.  Then we will show that there are no other integers that are a solution.\n</p><p><br />\nTo find the solution, note that the absolute value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6f40f0cb879514c68221dc060a24e469fbcbed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"33\" /> is usually smaller than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> should be close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />.  Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e7aff059941e3f0ee2fdd62131229e180a2ca97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2005$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" /> results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/2/982ea6e6b630e7781be0634f31f9c702da839493.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"33\" />.  Trying out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/188ff54fb17d78ba1e5d7470da98f02318230255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2006$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" /> results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f1d0b3fc57dafde27fd32ac06d68d15388db588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"33\" />, so that value is a solution.\n</p><p><br />\nTo show that there are no other integers that are a solution, we will consider two cases: one where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> and one where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/a/83acea62fcc41cc5383b7abbb8192af8e4722d5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; 2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /></b>\n</p><p>The highest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> that meets the conditions is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />, and in that condition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/1/4c10f95e2d1dd80f9ec8f3555b944a262e70fceb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor=2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nAssume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd906c8b237c771457d8ead737766ea329829815.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m - \\left \\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005} \\right \\rfloor &lt; 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"33\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a9522e7db2df2c407113874d60822d160bd798cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2005a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> are integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7a58270d4285821716c6093a83541f3ea31dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 0$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/3/553300aa5df7a997376e5719abf93b616d0cbe53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2005a - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005a}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2004a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"330\" height=\"43\" />.  Additionally, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/1/1518da9ba749c59171b9b43116af5d5e7eda7009.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} m-1-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m-1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor &amp;= 2005a - 1 - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005a - 1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor \\\\ &amp;= 2005a - 1 - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005(a-1) + 2004}{2005} \\right\\rfloor \\\\ &amp;= 2005a - 1 - a + 1 \\\\ &amp;= 2004a. \\end{align*}\" width=\"435\" height=\"138\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff39ba262fdf0fc8425b3548976378ba294afba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/144374065bb4db0d49b21a4b90ccd8fcaea7f7ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2005a + b - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005a+b}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2004a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"421\" height=\"43\" />.  Additionally,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16af40019301feb299f14f822bfcaadfc94ca55c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} m-1-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m-1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor &amp;= 2005a + b - 1 - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005a + b - 1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor \\\\ &amp;= 2005a + b - 1 - a \\\\ &amp;= 2004a + b - 1. \\end{align*}\" width=\"422\" height=\"90\" />\nFor both cases, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/e/aeed826cb15132b452d25e5318cc782831e83f4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-1-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m-1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor \\le m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"265\" height=\"45\" />, so by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Induction\" title=\"Induction\">induction</a>, there are no integers less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> that satisfy the equation.\n</p><p><b>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/2/64266c9ef6bc3d00a4c26e4fe4ca662544e6220f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &gt; 2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /></b>\n</p><p>The lowest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> that meets the conditions is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0db9f93bcba529c93ae151a1ac5c740eec7cca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />, and in that condition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/b/3cbfb39ea22d46b2ed47e6c100c20d83301180ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor=2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nAssume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/620648098c1c69867d31c8e84f85f58a66497da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m - \\left \\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005} \\right \\rfloor &gt; 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"33\" />.  Once again, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a9522e7db2df2c407113874d60822d160bd798cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2005a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> are integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/636d47dbd1df8ba5007022c847f9b821a77f366f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/235295a362d2ceb6cf4455432c9ad50fb342d785.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2005a + 2004 - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005a+2004}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2004a + 2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"506\" height=\"43\" />.  Additionally, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a6cc7a97b2e2c40320f16935970a0bc83671913.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} m+1-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m+1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor &amp;= 2005a + 2005 - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005a +2005}{2005}\\right\\rfloor \\\\ &amp;= 2005a + 2005 - a - 1 \\\\ &amp;= 2004a + 2004 \\end{align*}\" width=\"417\" height=\"90\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/9934be0ea34ff8167035c6e172cb3ce33853c7d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &lt; 2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/144374065bb4db0d49b21a4b90ccd8fcaea7f7ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2005a + b - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005a+b}{2005}\\right\\rfloor = 2004a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"421\" height=\"43\" />.  Additionally,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964bdf6bc1b46f415405b74d9405d3287fb80162.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} m+1-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m+1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor &amp;= 2005a + b + 1 - \\left\\lfloor \\frac{2005a + b + 1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor \\\\ &amp;= 2005a + b + 1 - a \\\\ &amp;= 2004a + b + 1 \\end{align*}\" width=\"422\" height=\"90\" />\nFor both cases, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/2/462ae4b0c80ee28cacfd6d9e444b4892365c654c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+1-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m+1}{2005}\\right\\rfloor \\ge m-\\left\\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"259\" height=\"43\" />, so by induction, there are no integers greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> that satisfy the equation.\n</p><p><br />\nTherefore, there is only one integer that satisfies the original equation.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using Quotient-Remainder Theorem, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/1448cd483865133041104ed15d9126cf0fbc1497.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2005q+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, are integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b02c8d4491b5598c636e3ebd5f761cb726a3a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le r&lt; 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/0634621097fd75b9f33c004277dda3d5998fdd1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m - \\lfloor \\frac{m}{2005}\\rfloor =2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"34\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/f/12f62d82b408291281041c465cc0336ae36a754a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005q+r- \\lfloor \\frac{2005q+r}{2005}\\rfloor = 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"257\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>This simplifies down to\n</p><p>\\begin{align*} \n2005q+r-q&amp;=2005\\\\\n2004q+r&amp;=2005\\\\\nr&amp;=2005-2004q\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/1/a01a3533ad309ad8927cd5fafd5e187093ceb444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q\\le 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/e/c7e4c779fd8d94046df5d268653b680e1a723da3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r\\ge 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"16\" />, which violates the restriction that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eabc279ca1ed23277778847dfdb05c1761026a2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le r&lt;2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />.\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/3/463d9142d8a5f42615bb12de913b68ae67b7f421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/8/b08e07c301710c483c9ff43f265b357b05e1e67c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r&lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, which again violates the restriction that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eabc279ca1ed23277778847dfdb05c1761026a2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le r&lt;2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the only possible value for q is 1, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8a35f6346d73da147032d245a4433717df94716.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=2005-2004(1)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/312e2398078741c26176811bea622909f97e67d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2005q+r = 2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"17\" /> as our only answer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO\">2005 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 377/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 13261/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.760      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    6.760      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17748:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017205646 and revision id 227148. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}